          %title Stable homotopy theory  Sequential spectra
          %hr/
          %p
            We give an introduction to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+homotopy+category"} stable homotopy category
            and to its key computational tool, the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Adams+spectral+sequence"} Adams spectral sequence
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+categories"} model categories
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/highly+structured+ring+spectra"} highly structured ring spectra
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+S"} seminar
            we consider applications to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cobordism+theory"} cobordism theory
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+oriented+cohomology"} complex oriented cohomology
            such as to converge in the end to a glimpse of the modern picture of
            = succeed "._" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/chromatic+homotopy+theory"} chromatic homotopy theory
          %hr/
          %p Lecture notes.
          %p
            Main page:
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory"} Introduction to Stable homotopy theory
          %p
            Previous section:
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+P"} Prelude – Classical homotopy theory
          %p
            This section_
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+1"} Part 1 – Stable homotopy theory
          %p
            This subsection:
            %strong Part 1.1 – Stable homotopy theory – Sequential spectra
          %p
            Next subsection:
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+1-2"} Part 1.2 – Stable homotopy theory – Structured Spectra
          %p
            Next section:
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+2"} Part 2 – Adams spectral sequences
