            is to be the result of stabilizing the adjunction in prop.
            = succeed "," do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SuspensionAndLoopAdjunctionInClassicalHomotopyTheory"}
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+of+categories"} equivalence of categories
            in a compatible way, i.e. such as to fit into a diagram of categories of the form
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
