          %p
            Moreover, for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+homotopy+theory"} stable homotopy theory
            proper we are to refine this situation from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+categories"} homotopy categories
            to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+categories"} model categories
            and ask it to be the diagram of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+functors"} derived functors
            (according to
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+P#QuillenAdjunctionInducesAdjunctionOnHomotopyCategories"} this prop.
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Quillen+adjunctions"} Quillen adjunctions
            (
            %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+P#QuillenAdjunction"}> def.
            )
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
