              (Hence the stable homotopy groups of an Omega-spectrum realize the general pattern discussed in example
              = succeed ".)" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#BlueprintForIdeaOfOmegaSpectra"}
          .proof
            %h6#proof_4 Proof
            %p
              For an Omega-spectrum, the adjunct structure maps
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
