              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/relative+cell+complex"} relative cell complex
              and since the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/1-sphere"} 1-sphere
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
