          %h3#StabilityOfTheStableModelStructure Stability of the homotopy theory
          %p
            We discuss that the stable model structure
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi SeqSpec
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msub
                    %mi Top
                    %mi cg
                  %msub
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mi stable
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SeqSpec(Top_{cg})_{stable}
            of theorem
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#StableModelStructureOnSequentialSpectraIsModelCategory"}
            is indeed a
            = succeed "," do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+model+category"} stable model category
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reduced+suspension"} reduced suspension
            operation is an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+of+categories"} equivalence of categories
            from the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+homotopy+category"} stable homotopy category
            (def.
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TheStableHomotopyCategory"}
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#StableModelStructureOnSequentiaSpectraIsStableModelCategory"}
            below.
          #StableModelCategory.num_defn
            %h6#definition_21 Definition
            %p
              A
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pointed+category"} pointed
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+category"} model category
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
              (
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+P#HomotopyCategoryOfPointedModelStructureIsEnrichedInPointedSets"}> exmpl.
              ) is called a
              %strong
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+model+category"} stable model category
