            %p
              This implies the statement, since by lemma
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#AdjunctionBetweenSequentialSpectraAndSequentialTSpectra"}
              the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjunction+unit"} adjunction unit
              is a stable weak equivalence, so that we get natural isomorphisms
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Σ
                    %mi X
                    %mo ≃
                    %msub
                      %mi L
                      %mn 2
                    %msub
                      %mi R
                      %mn 2
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi Σ
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
