                %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+1-2#MonoidalStableModelStructure"} The stable model structure on structured spectra
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
