                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} c_\ast
              is an isomorphism. Since this holds
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+transformation"} naturally
              for all
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
