                    \\,.
            %p This is the commutativity of the right part (2) of the diagram to be proven.
            %p So far we have shown that
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
