            %p
              Here the top row is
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/long+exact+sequence"} long exact
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+fiber+sequence"} homotopy fiber sequence
              to the left that holds in the homotopy category of any model catgeory (
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+P#LongFiberSequence"}> prop.
              ). Moreover, the bottom sequence is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/long+exact+sequence"} long exact
              by prop.
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LongFiberSequencesOfMapsOfSpectra"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/five+lemma"} five lemma
              implies that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
